title Kaasu: Payment confirmation flow
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Customer [icon: smartphone, color: "#5B6168"]
Shop backend [icon: shopping-cart, color: "#14171A"]
Kaasu [icon: server, color: "#0F7B5F"]
Merchant [icon: user, color: "#14171A"]
Android Forwarder [icon: android, color: "#E8A33D"]
Merchant bank [icon: credit-card, color: "#5B6168"]

Shop backend > Kaasu: Create order (idempotent)
Kaasu > Kaasu: Reserve ₹499.07 or queue
Kaasu > Shop backend: Pay link
Customer > Kaasu: Open pay page
Customer > Merchant bank: Pay ₹499.07 (UPI)
Merchant bank > Android Forwarder: SMS / app alert
Android Forwarder > Kaasu: Signed alert
Kaasu > Kaasu: Verify, dedupe, score
alt [label: Auto-confirm, color: "#0F7B5F", icon: check-circle] {
  Kaasu > Kaasu: Ledger + outbox
  Kaasu > Shop backend: Webhook (retried till 2xx)
  Kaasu > Merchant: Voice: ₹499 received
  Kaasu > Customer: Confirmed (live)
}
else [label: Needs your OK, color: "#9A5410", icon: alert-circle] {
  Kaasu > Merchant: Mismatch / late / big
  Merchant > Kaasu: Confirm (passkey)
  Kaasu > Shop backend: Webhook: decision
}
Merchant > Kaasu: Statement CSV
Kaasu > Merchant: Mismatches
